# Abstract
# --------
# The CPU build of PyTorch that the test, coverage, integration and model zoo
# workflows install. Its files are only on the PyTorch package index, which
# the environments that run `make lock` may not reach, so the lock file
# requirements-ci-torch.txt is compiled by the Torch Lock workflow
# (.github/workflows/torch-lock.yml) against that index, with a SHA-256 hash
# for every distribution. Copy the file from the log or the artifact of the
# workflow run into the repository after changing this file.
# =============================================================================

torch  # PyTorch, CPU build from https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu.

